# DC Controller Documentation Rule

- Every function added or modified in `devices/dc_controller.py` must include a short docstring or leading comment describing its purpose.
- Keep functions small and focused; prefer extracting shared connection/output logic into reusable helpers.
- When adding new DC controller behavior, update the module-level comments/docstrings instead of leaving undocumented helper functions.
